{"2083160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Disfigure", "steam_appid": 2083160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2497100, 5126840], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disfigure is a horde survivor game with a horror twist. In an arena shrouded in shadow, pay close attention to your surroundings—vision is restricted and monsters can be anywhere. <strong>Swap between Circle and Cone Vision modes:</strong> one lets you see nearby, while the other lets you see farther in one direction. Fight escalating hordes, bosses, and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/7ab8a2b49cf640aeb6909fac20a221ee.poster.avif?t=1787345474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/7ab8a2b49cf640aeb6909fac20a221ee.webm?t=1787345474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/7ab8a2b49cf640aeb6909fac20a221ee.mp4?t=1787345474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>EXP</strong> from enemies to level up and discover <strong>hundreds of upgrades.</strong> From singularities to radiation, the possibilities are limitless. You can wield lightning and fire, shoot thousands of bullets, create a whirlwind of swords... the choice is yours. <strong>Every upgrade tree changes the way you play.</strong> Even Vision itself can be shaped to your advantage: will you sacrifice it to increase power, or bolster it as your beacon in the depths?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/1d426013be74285257f0c81ebd3c2096.poster.avif?t=1787345474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/1d426013be74285257f0c81ebd3c2096.webm?t=1787345474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/1d426013be74285257f0c81ebd3c2096.mp4?t=1787345474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run rewards you with <strong>Credits</strong> to unlock new weapons, gear, and permanent upgrades. Each weapon has its own unique projectiles and perks, offering plenty of options to suit your playstyle. <i>(There's a flamethrower!)</i> Invest your earnings into powering up your character or adding run modifiers that reshape future runs. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/6e548c3ea0624db0d988d5a5902ca707.poster.avif?t=1787345474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/6e548c3ea0624db0d988d5a5902ca707.webm?t=1787345474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/6e548c3ea0624db0d988d5a5902ca707.mp4?t=1787345474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique fog-of-war vision mechanic that obscures your line of sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20–30 minute runs</strong> with quick restarts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>230+ upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 unique weapons</strong> featuring guns, swords, saws, explosives, lasers, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>39 run mutations</strong> that modify game rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 handcrafted maps</strong> featuring 70+ enemies and 15 boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual Aiming with an Aim Assist toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro grimdark art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden, Ruby, and Diamond challenge modes to test your skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/2d456a6941aef19808f47e1c3c1f48c1.poster.avif?t=1787345474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/2d456a6941aef19808f47e1c3c1f48c1.webm?t=1787345474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/2d456a6941aef19808f47e1c3c1f48c1.mp4?t=1787345474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disfigure is a horde survivor game with a horror twist. In an arena shrouded in shadow, pay close attention to your surroundings—vision is restricted and monsters can be anywhere. <strong>Swap between Circle and Cone Vision modes:</strong> one lets you see nearby, while the other lets you see farther in one direction. Fight escalating hordes, bosses, and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co