r!)</i> Invest your earnings into powering up your character or adding run modifiers that reshape future runs. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/6e548c3ea0624db0d988d5a5902ca707.poster.avif?t=1787345474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/6e548c3ea0624db0d988d5a5902ca707.webm?t=1787345474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/6e548c3ea0624db0d988d5a5902ca707.mp4?t=1787345474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique fog-of-war vision mechanic that obscures your line of sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20–30 minute runs</strong> with quick restarts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>230+ upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 unique weapons</strong> featuring guns, swords, saws, explosives, lasers, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>39 run mutations</strong> that modify game rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 handcrafted maps</strong> featuring 70+ enemies and 15 boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual Aiming with an Aim Assist toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro grimdark art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden, Ruby, and Diamond challenge modes to test your skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c